#: ../../tools/genenetwork_tools.rst:67 a629d9dc6abb4963bbe610d1f8406d9f
msgid ""
"**Description**: List all datasets available for a specific genetic cross"
" population in GeneNetwork. Datasets represent different tissues, time "
"points, or measurement technologies for the population (e.g., 'BXD Brain "
"mRNA', 'BXD Liver Metabolites', 'BXD Phenotype'). Returns dataset names, "
"abbreviations, data types, and timestamps. Use "
"GeneNetwork\\_list\\_groups to find group names (e.g., 'bxd' for BXD "
"cross)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/genenetwork_tools.rst:71 5d6dd58a6bc641dd97015c9f4788bb0d
msgid ""
"``group`` (string) (required) Genetic cross group name in lowercase "
"(e.g., 'bxd', 'bxh', 'hxb', 'bnlx-srjr-f2'). Obtain from "
"GeneNetwork\\_list\\_groups."
msgstr ""

