#: ../../tools/genenetwork_tools.rst:129 dc792e234c044a648851d94a04279095
msgid ""
"**Description**: List all species available in GeneNetwork, the open "
"systems genetics database for behavioral, neural, and physiological "
"phenotypes. GeneNetwork contains genetic cross data for 13+ model "
"organisms including mouse (BXD, BXH, AXB, etc.), rat, Arabidopsis, human,"
" zebrafish, and barley. Returns species names and taxonomy IDs for use "
"with other GeneNetwork tools."
msgstr ""

